    "title": "Glossary — words we use",
    "audience": "all",
    "keywords": "glossary, meaning, words, terminology, stage, revision, reversal, archive, module",
    "body": "# Glossary — words we use\n\n- **Alteration** — a fitting fix after delivery (shorten, loosen…). Tracked until marked done.\n- **Archive** — hide something without deleting it. Archived customers, orders and businesses keep all history and can be restored.\n- **Balance / outstanding** — what the customer still owes on an order: total minus net paid.\n- **Cashbook** — the daily cash/bank day book.\n- **Catalog** — your reusable price list.\n- **Consent** — the customer's permission to receive WhatsApp messages.\n- **Custom field** — an extra box you added (fabric type, neck size…).\n- **Idempotency** — saving twice with the same save-key creates one record, not two. Protects you on flaky connections.\n- **Invoice** — the order's printable bill: items, total, payments, balance.\n- **Journal** — the double-entry accounting record behind a transaction.\n- **Membership** — one person's access to one business, with one role.\n- **Module** — a switchable feature area (Inventory, Cashbook…). Owners switch modules in Business settings.\n- **Platform** — the team that runs the whole system (not a single shop).\n- **Receipt** — proof of one payment.\n- **Restore** — bring an archived record back to normal lists.\n- **Reversal** — the correction entry that undoes a posted payment. Payments are never edited or deleted.\n- **Revision** — one saved version of measurements. New saves add revisions; old ones stay.\n- **Role** — a named set of permissions (Counter, Tailor, Manager…).\n- **Stage** — a step an order passes through (Cutting, Stitching, Ready…).\n- **Tenant** — one business's private data area. Tenants can never see each other's records.\n- **Trial / grace period** — free starting period, and the extra days after a period ends before writes pause.\n\n## Roman Urdu mein\nMushkil alfaaz ki sada tareefain upar di gayi hain. Sab se aham: **Archive** matlab chhupana (delete nahi), **Reversal** matlab ghalat payment ki durustgi (purani entry rehti hai), aur **Stage** matlab order ka marhala."
