    "id": "payments",
    "title": "Payments, receipts and exports",
    "audience": "business",
    "keywords": "payment, receipt, reversal, refund, correction, outstanding, advance, invoice, export, csv",
    "body": "# Payments, receipts and exports\n\n## What this is\nMoney in: advances and balances, printed receipts, corrections done properly, and exports for your records.\n\n## Record a payment\n1. Open the order and choose **Record payment**.\n2. Type the amount exactly as received and the method (Cash, Bank, Digital).\n3. Save. The receipt number is assigned automatically; the order's outstanding balance drops at once.\n\n## Receipts\nEvery payment can be re-printed or sent: **Receipt PDF** downloads it; on mobile you can share it straight to the customer's WhatsApp.\n\n## Corrections — read this twice\nA posted payment is never edited and never deleted. Typed 5,000 instead of 500? Use **Reverse** on that payment with a reason, then record the correct payment. Both entries stay visible — that is what makes the ledger trustworthy.\n\n## Invoice for an order\n**Invoice PDF** (order card) shows all items, the order total, every payment and the balance due. **Export CSV** buttons on Customers, Orders and Payments download lists for Excel; **Ledger CSV** (Payments page) exports cashbook entries. Very long exports are capped and the file says so — narrow by screen first if that happens.\n\n## Common mistakes\n- Taking a payment on the wrong order. Check the order number on the receipt before handing it over.\n- Recording tomorrow's promised payment today. Only record money actually received.\n\n## Permission warnings\nRecording and reversing need **payments:write**; viewing and receipts need **payments:read**; ledger export needs **cashbook:read**. Reversals should be a senior person's job.\n\n## Roman Urdu mein\nPayment post ho jaye to woh kabhi edit ya delete nahi hoti. Ghalti ho to wajah likh kar **Reverse** karein aur sahi payment dobara darj karein. Har payment ki receipt PDF milti hai, aur lists **Export CSV** se Excel ke liye download hoti hain."
