    "body": "# Business settings and branding\n\n## What this is\nThe control room for how your workspace looks and behaves: name, logo, modules, fields, workflow stages, dashboard widgets and payment methods.\n\n## Where to find it\nWeb: **Business settings**. Mobile: **More**, then the Business settings item.\n\n## What you can change\n- **Branding** — business name, logo style/colours or logo URL. Receipts, invoices and sign-in show these.\n- **Modules** — switch features on/off for the whole business.\n- **Item types and custom fields** — see the owner checklist in *Setting up your business*.\n- **Workflow stages** — the steps your orders travel through.\n- **Dashboard widgets** — which counters the Overview shows.\n- **Payment methods** — Cash, Bank, Digital (methods customers can use with you).\n\n## Save carefully\nSaving publishes immediately for the whole team and is written to the configuration history, so an earlier version can be reviewed. Change one thing at a time until you learn the effects.\n\n## Common mistakes\n- Switching off a module your team still uses daily. Their menu loses it at once (data is safe and returns when you switch back on).\n- A logo URL that needs a login to view. Use a public image address or the built-in logo styles.\n\n## Permission warnings\nEverything here needs **settings:manage**. Keep this permission with owners and one trusted deputy.\n\n## Roman Urdu mein\nBusiness settings se naam, logo, modules aur order stages badalte hain. Har tabdeeli foran poori team par lagu hoti hai aur history mein mehfooz rehti hai — is liye ek waqt mein ek hi cheez badlein."
