    "keywords": "staff, team, role, permission, invite, password reset, deactivate, remove member",
    "body": "# Staff, roles and passwords\n\n## What this is\nWho can sign in to your business, what each person is allowed to do, and what to do when someone forgets a password.\n\n## Where to find it\nWeb: **Business settings**, then **Team**. Mobile: **More**, then Business settings, then Team.\n\n## Add a team member\n1. Choose **Create member**, type their name, email and a temporary password (at least 16 characters).\n2. Pick a role. Create roles first if none fit: **Create role**, name it for the job (Counter, Tailor, Manager) and tick only the permissions that job needs.\n3. Share the temporary password privately (in person is best). At their first sign-in the app makes them choose their own password.\n\n## Forgot password? (very common)\nThere is deliberately no \"forgot password\" email — passwords are reset by people, not links:\n1. Owner (or a **staff:manage** holder) opens **Team**, finds the member, chooses **Reset password**.\n2. Type a new temporary password and confirm. The member is signed out everywhere at once.\n3. They sign in with the temporary password and must choose their own immediately.\n\nYou can also change **your own** password any time: web account menu → **Change password**; mobile **Settings**, then the **Password** section.\n\n## Removing access\n- **Deactivate or remove member** signs them out and blocks the business for them; their past work stays under their name. Removing asks for confirmation.\n- The business owner account cannot be removed, and you cannot remove or reset yourself — another admin must do it.\n\n## Common mistakes\n- Giving everyone the owner role \"to keep it simple\". One shared all-powerful account means one leaked password owns the shop.\n- Writing temporary passwords in the shop WhatsApp group. Hand them over privately and let the forced change do its work.\n\n## Permission warnings\nTeam management needs **staff:manage**. Role permissions can never exceed your own — the app blocks granting what you do not hold.\n\n## Roman Urdu mein\nTeam yahan banta hai: member banayein, role dein, arzi (temporary) password dein — pehli sign-in par woh apna password khud chunta hai. Password bhool jaye to owner **Reset password** karega; koi email link nahi aata. Har shakhs ko sirf us ke kaam ki permission dein."
